#: mod/factionInfo.lua:1
msgid "Independent"
msgstr "Unabhängige"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:3
msgid ""
"Despite appearing as a faction, independents are distinguished primarily by "
"having no strong affiliation with any faction at all. Most traders consider "
"themselves independent, though certain voices have started to speak up about "
"creating a merchant faction."
msgstr "Unabhängige Schiffe, die keiner Fraktion angehören."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:101
msgid "Imperial"
msgstr "Imperium"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:103
msgid "Remnants of the Imperial Forces"
msgstr "Überreste der Imperialen Streitkräfte"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:105
msgid "New Republic"
msgstr "Neue Republik"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:107
msgid "The forces of the New Republic"
msgstr "Die Streitkräfte der neuen Republik"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:110
msgid "Crimson Dawn"
msgstr "Crimson Dawn"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:112
msgid "Ships of the Crimson Dawn syndicate"
msgstr "Schiffe des Crimson Dawn Syndikats"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:131
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Transporter"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:131
msgid "Transport craft from Endor"
msgstr "Transportschiffe von Endor"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:135
msgid "Endor"
msgstr "Endor"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:137
msgid "Endor flight control and navigation infrastructure."
msgstr "Endor Flugkontrolle und Navigations-Infrastruktur."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:139
msgid "Raider"
msgstr "Raider"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:141
msgid ""
"Raiders that may attack (more or less) innocent transportation vehicles."
msgstr ""
"Beutemacher, die es auf (mehr oder weniger) unschuldige Transportschiffe "
"abgesehen haben."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:144
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Umgebung"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:146
msgid "Debris flying around."
msgstr "Herumschwirrende Trümmer."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:149
msgid "Sky Patrol"
msgstr "Sky Partol"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:151
msgid "Endor Sky Patrol - they enforce the law in orbit."
msgstr "Endor Sky Patrol - die Ordnungshüter im Orbit von Endor."

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:155
msgid "Criminals"
msgstr "Kriminelle"

#: mod/factionInfo.lua:157
msgid ""
"Despite appearing as a faction, criminals are distinguished primarily by "
"having no strong affiliation with any faction at all. Pirates, outlaws and "
"fugitives are considered criminals."
msgstr ""
"Piraten, Gesetzesbrecher und Flüchtlinge, die allesamt als Kriminelle "
"gesehen werden."
